<title>HONG KONG: Carr Indosuez sets warrants on Amoy Prop.</title>
<headline>Carr Indosuez sets warrants on Amoy Prop.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carr Indosuez Asia (Derivatives) Ltd said it launched a further 300 million American-style call warrants on Amoy Properties Ltd, on top of an issue of 300 million in  May.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p>STRIKE PRICE    HK$8.544	   PREMIUM	 9.61 PCT</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.154	   GEARING	 5.97 X</p>
<p>EXPIRATION	30.JUNE.97	 PAYDATE	 TO BE ANNOUNCED</p>
<p>LISTING	   HONG KONG	  BOARD LOT     5,000</p>
<p>SPOT PRICE	HK$9.20</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
